    "T3_modulus_independent_dyadic_f1_schedule": "Choosing minimal b >= 1 with 2^b >= max(2, 2*n*(b+1)*L_box(m, s_F)) and w = ceil(log_2(2*n*(b+1)*s)) bounds intended partner failure by 1/(n*(b+1)). It bounds DCP bad-register mass only conditional on independent two-point geometry."
